### Symptom Reporting API Tests
### Use these with VS Code REST Client extension

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@userId = MbG3wwDSH1o5lqQYoFG1

# =============================================================================
# Report Symptoms (Create)
# =============================================================================

### Report a basic symptom
POST {{baseUrl}}/symptoms/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symptom_name": "headache",
  "severity": 3,
  "description": "Mild headache in the morning"
}

###

### Report symptom with context
POST {{baseUrl}}/symptoms/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symptom_name": "fatigue",
  "severity": 4,
  "description": "Feeling very tired after lunch",
  "context": {
    "sleep_hours": 6.5,
    "stress_level": 4,
    "notes": "Had a busy morning"
  }
}

###

### Report a high-severity symptom
POST {{baseUrl}}/symptoms/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symptom_name": "nausea",
  "severity": 4,
  "description": "Morning sickness"
}

###

# =============================================================================
# Get Symptoms (Read)
# =============================================================================

### Get recent symptoms (last 7 days)
GET {{baseUrl}}/symptoms/{{userId}}

###

### Get symptoms from last 30 days
GET {{baseUrl}}/symptoms/{{userId}}?days=30&limit=20

###

### Get a specific symptom by ID
# Replace {stone_id} with actual ID from create response
GET {{baseUrl}}/symptoms/{{userId}}/{stone_id}

###

### Get symptoms by date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/symptoms/{{userId}}/range?start_date=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&end_date=2026-01-31T23:59:59Z

###

### Get symptoms by date range filtered by name
GET {{baseUrl}}/symptoms/{{userId}}/range?start_date=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&end_date=2026-01-31T23:59:59Z&symptom_name=headache

###

# =============================================================================
# Update Symptoms
# =============================================================================

### Update symptom severity
# Replace {stone_id} with actual ID
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/symptoms/{{userId}}/{stone_id}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "severity": 2,
  "description": "Feeling better now"
}

###

# =============================================================================
# Symptom Analysis
# =============================================================================

### Get all symptom frequencies (last 30 days)
GET {{baseUrl}}/symptoms/{{userId}}/analysis/all

###

### Get all symptom frequencies (last 7 days)
GET {{baseUrl}}/symptoms/{{userId}}/analysis/all?days=7

###

### Analyze specific symptom
GET {{baseUrl}}/symptoms/{{userId}}/analysis/headache

###

### Analyze specific symptom (longer period)
GET {{baseUrl}}/symptoms/{{userId}}/analysis/fatigue?days=60

###

# =============================================================================
# Delete Symptoms
# =============================================================================

### Delete a symptom
# Replace {stone_id} with actual ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/symptoms/{{userId}}/{stone_id}

###
